DTEND:20261004T080000Z
SUMMARY:Machina Records Presents: Circuit - Dj Marfox
LOCATION:The Boombox Miami\, 4447 Southwest 75th Avenue\, Miami\, FL 33155
 \, USA
DESCRIPTION:Machina Records presents "Circuit" — the first edition of the
 ir label party in Miami. Headlining the night is the prolific DJ Marfox fr
 om Portugal\, pioneer of the Kuduro/Batida sound born out of Angola and la
 bel head of Príncipe Discos. Joining him is SAY3\, a Liberian/Haitian DJ 
 and early adopter of the Batida sound. Featured on Club Djembe alongside D
 J Lycox\, he's no stranger to the sonic palette of this Angolan sound. Mac
 hina Records label head RARA goes B2B with Ianko FJ\, providing support fo
 r this deep night of Afrobeat and Afro-electronica. Boombox residents Mang
 o and Guacharo hold down the fort for the night.\nLineup: Dj Marfox\, RARA
 \, Say3\, ianko fj\, mango.\nTags: afro house\, afrobeat\, afrobeats\, ele
 ctronica\nPresented by: omnisoundsevents\nTickets: Tier 1 $13.33\nhttps://
 shotgun.live/en/events/machina-records-presents-circuit
URL:https://shotgun.live/en/events/machina-records-presents-circuit
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:afro house,afrobeat,afrobeats,electronica
GEO:25.7287781;-80.3169309
END:VEVENT
